================= GO / NO-GO SUMMARY =================
For the 3-species RAMP validation to be reachable, you want to see:
  - each human RAMP1/2/3 with a lemur homolog and a mouse homolog
  - ortholog_type that is interpretable (one2one / one2many / many2many)
  - lemur gene names that are real symbols, not only LOC… placeholders
  - reasonable perc_id (not near-zero)

If lemur RAMP homologs are missing or all LOC/ambiguous: the finding may
not be cleanly reproducible from Ensembl homology alone — that is itself a
real result (it's what Ezran flag), but it changes the validation plan.
